    "detailed_description": "\u00b7This is a role-playing game about tennis, where players control beautiful girls to participate in tennis competitions.<br />\r\n\u00b7There are many girls in the college who enjoy playing tennis. (Currently, nearly 20 characters have been created)<br />\r\n\u00b7You can improve your character's level through practice matches and earn funds through performance matches.<br />\r\n\u00b7Players can start a challenge when they find a girl they like, and once the challenge is successful, the girl can be added to their team.<br />\r\n\u00b7The girl who has been defeated, can watch her photos!<br />\r\n\u00b7For the girls, start playing!",
